** Sessions 7 - 14: Welcome to Delphi! **


   For this (and likely future ones) entry into "The Chronicles of
Elryk", I've combined several of my playing sessions. Reason being
that I have to sometimes wait a full day before I can see my previous
entry (post). Besides; I see little use in posting several posts, in
the thread, which have but a few lines of text in them...



Sessions 7, 8, and 9:
---------------------

   I'm not exploring the caverns any further with a mindflayer down
there. I'll do some organizing and loot management here, then head
back to the Mazes of Menace.

   Notable things were; that I had acquired two more large boxes from
the lower Caverns, and thus had containers for my loot. Brought two of
them to the Mazes of Menace. I also found a +2 hooded cloak.

   Spent time shuttling some stuff back and forth from; Temple Town to
dungeon level 3, where I had set up another temporary base camp.

   Then I got busy in real life. I didn't play Nethack for a few
months...



